WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 37]

01:47.580 --> 01:48.100
Senior.

01:49.820 --> 01:50.300
Senior.

01:50.570 --> 01:51.060
Come on.

01:51.780 --> 01:52.380
Sit here.

01:55.340 --> 01:55.900
Senior.

01:56.780 --> 01:58.900
I was looking through my mother's luggage the other day

01:58.900 --> 01:59.780
and saw these.

02:00.660 --> 02:01.490
I thought

02:02.100 --> 02:04.100
these must be prepared for my wedding,

02:04.100 --> 02:06.500
so I brought them here for you to take a look .

02:06.530 --> 02:07.100
Rong.

02:07.860 --> 02:09.520
These are not for current use.

02:13.620 --> 02:14.090
Look.

02:15.100 --> 02:16.100
This hairpin

02:16.460 --> 02:17.340
was carved from a phoenix tree

02:17.340 --> 02:19.070
that I found through hard work.

02:19.700 --> 02:20.610
I set up a formation

02:20.610 --> 02:23.220
to gather the essence of heaven and earth for seventy-seven forty-nine days

02:23.220 --> 02:25.820
before using it as the raw material for carving.

02:25.820 --> 02:26.780
Is it glossy?

02:27.220 --> 02:29.010
You wasted so much time and cultivation

02:29.010 --> 02:30.660
just for such a hairpin?

02:30.860 --> 02:32.540
Don't you think it's worth it?

02:33.860 --> 02:35.220
What did you carve this odd-shaped hairpin

02:35.220 --> 02:36.260
for?

02:37.300 --> 02:38.980
Even if you can't become an Immortal,

02:38.980 --> 02:40.740
you should keep improving yourself.

02:40.740 --> 02:42.870
Do you understand my intention or not?

02:43.020 --> 02:43.730
Senior.

02:44.100 --> 02:44.740
I knew

02:45.900 --> 02:47.980
that perhaps the best bride-price for you

02:47.980 --> 02:49.780
was for me to become an Immortal.

02:51.579 --> 02:52.540
But I was useless

02:53.340 --> 02:54.400
and failed to do it.

02:55.740 --> 02:56.340
I'm sorry.

02:59.579 --> 03:01.980
That's why I made this hairpin with my own hands

03:01.980 --> 03:03.580
as my courtship token to you.

03:06.580 --> 03:07.540
I like it.

03:14.610 --> 03:15.980
I have to find a way to clear the evil spirit of the immortal root

03:15.980 --> 03:18.060
for her.

03:26.340 --> 03:26.980
My Lord!

03:28.460 --> 03:29.300
My Lord!

03:34.660 --> 03:35.340
Mr. Tai.

03:37.620 --> 03:40.420
Has Fu already usurped the position of Demon King?

03:47.260 --> 03:48.520
He ended up continuing

03:50.300 --> 03:51.810
his wrongdoing.

03:51.810 --> 03:52.940
My Lord.

03:52.940 --> 03:54.870
You could only rely on water energy

03:54.900 --> 03:56.829
to relieve your serious injuries.

03:57.260 --> 03:59.220
While General Fu plotted against you

03:59.220 --> 04:00.860
and took away your water energy.

04:00.860 --> 04:03.100
He did it to kill you.

04:04.900 --> 04:07.020
His mind has been bewitched by others.

04:07.020 --> 04:08.880
He is no longer that Fu I once knew.

04:08.940 --> 04:10.380
What he wants is...

04:11.180 --> 04:13.100
the entire Three Realms.

04:15.820 --> 04:16.660
All he wants

04:20.100 --> 04:21.630
is for Luo Ning to come back.

04:22.220 --> 04:23.130
He is chasing

04:24.740 --> 04:26.780
an unachievable dream.

04:30.340 --> 04:30.820
Mr. Tai.

04:32.370 --> 04:33.540
Please do me a favor.

04:35.220 --> 04:36.420
At your service.

04:36.980 --> 04:39.090
Fu's purpose is Four Seasons Monument.

04:39.090 --> 04:40.700
Tell Luo Ge and Liu Shao

04:40.980 --> 04:42.060
to be careful of Fu.

04:43.090 --> 04:45.409
I'll go find them now.

04:51.140 --> 04:52.060
General Fu!

04:54.940 --> 04:57.370
Since you are so loyal to my brother,

04:58.860 --> 05:00.740
you should stay in Demon Palace forever

05:00.740 --> 05:01.800
to take care of him.

05:08.540 --> 05:09.140
Mr. Tai.

05:09.660 --> 05:10.300
Mr. Tai!

05:21.700 --> 05:22.260
Brother.

05:23.650 --> 05:25.650
I'll attack  Immortal Palace myself

05:26.700 --> 05:27.850
to show them

05:29.900 --> 05:31.700
that it's useless to be careful.

05:33.420 --> 05:34.420
I can do

05:35.620 --> 05:36.820
whatever I want to do.

05:37.820 --> 05:39.880
I can definitely bring Luo Ning back.

05:46.540 --> 05:48.200
You can scold me if you want to.

05:48.780 --> 05:50.240
Don't look at me like that.

05:53.460 --> 05:55.590
No one can stop me from saving Luo Ning.

06:34.250 --> 06:34.980
I know

06:35.730 --> 06:37.990
you want to split Four Seasons Monument.

06:38.580 --> 06:40.100
You still need Moon Sword anyhow.

06:40.100 --> 06:41.760
Then we'll get his Moon Sword.

06:47.540 --> 06:48.700
What's wrong?

06:50.420 --> 06:50.950
Nothing.

06:52.060 --> 06:53.740
You don't need to worry about anything

06:53.740 --> 06:55.470
with such strong cultivation.

06:59.780 --> 07:01.980
You don't have to take part in the attack on the Demon Palace.

07:01.980 --> 07:02.500
Why?

07:03.100 --> 07:04.820
I'm afraid you would hesitate.

07:04.820 --> 07:06.780
Are you worried that I would help Luo Ge?

07:06.780 --> 07:07.860
But didn't you also say

07:07.860 --> 07:09.380
that you didn't want Luo Ge to die?

07:09.380 --> 07:11.240
I did want to spare him from death.

07:11.340 --> 07:12.700
But that would only be possible

07:12.700 --> 07:16.500
if Luo Ge was willing to split the Four Seasons Monument for Luo Ning.

07:16.620 --> 07:19.220
All those who prevent me from rescuing Luo Ning

07:22.260 --> 07:23.820
deserve to die.

07:26.860 --> 07:28.690
He is so untrustworthy.

07:29.420 --> 07:30.370
Fu.

07:30.580 --> 07:31.700
In that case,

07:32.020 --> 07:33.820
I'm going to spoil your plan too.

07:34.220 --> 07:36.340
I will make you regret it.

07:49.540 --> 07:50.620
I heard that the new Demon King

07:50.620 --> 07:51.950
has set up heavy guards.

07:52.010 --> 07:53.220
Who would dare to break in?

07:53.220 --> 07:55.260
However, Demon King and the leaders are not here,

07:55.260 --> 07:57.590
and all the masters have returned to land,

07:57.659 --> 07:59.220
so we should be careful.

08:09.300 --> 08:09.820
Mr. Tai.

08:14.060 --> 08:15.500
Has something happened to the demon world?

08:15.500 --> 08:16.900
Why did fu become Demon King?

08:16.900 --> 08:17.830
What about He Na?

08:18.660 --> 08:19.990
Mr. Tai, say something.

08:20.100 --> 08:20.620
Mr. Tai!

08:51.060 --> 08:52.060
You finally came.

09:03.250 --> 09:04.250
Immortal Master?

09:08.580 --> 09:09.220
Who is it?

09:12.780 --> 09:14.180
The traitor I saw that day

09:14.220 --> 09:15.210
was you?

09:17.300 --> 09:17.780
No.

09:19.210 --> 09:21.500
Immortal Master has always been upright.

09:21.500 --> 09:22.630
He wouldn't do this.

09:25.260 --> 09:26.860
You are not Immortal Master.

09:27.580 --> 09:29.420
Can't you recognize me?

09:42.130 --> 09:43.380
Is everything ready?

09:43.980 --> 09:45.380
Everything is prepared,

09:46.330 --> 09:47.780
except for one thing.

09:51.100 --> 09:52.500
Then let Luo Ge

09:52.700 --> 09:55.260
send that thing here in person.

10:10.820 --> 10:11.330
Rong.

10:13.180 --> 10:13.650
Senior.

10:13.820 --> 10:14.940
What book are you reading?

10:14.940 --> 10:15.800
I'm looking for

10:15.820 --> 10:18.620
a way to clear the evil spirit of the immortal root.

10:21.780 --> 10:22.840
I've looked for it.

10:23.460 --> 10:24.900
There is no other way

10:26.580 --> 10:28.510
except to enable Xilun Formation.

10:32.300 --> 10:34.760
But to enable this useless Xilun Formation,

10:34.820 --> 10:37.500
either I need to get Sun Spring and sacrifice a disciple's life,

10:37.500 --> 10:38.180
or

10:39.180 --> 10:41.220
I have to sacrifice the best Immortal

10:41.220 --> 10:42.420
as the eye of formation.

10:42.420 --> 10:44.620
I can't sacrifice other people's lives

10:44.660 --> 10:46.590
just because I want to be Immortal.

10:47.220 --> 10:48.380
If that's the only way,

10:48.380 --> 10:50.310
I'd rather not become an Immortal.

10:51.140 --> 10:51.700
Rong.

10:58.410 --> 10:59.870
Four Seasons Monument...

11:13.530 --> 11:14.100
Luo Ge.

11:14.540 --> 11:15.500
What's going on?

11:16.980 --> 11:19.180
Someone disturbed the sealed spiritual source

11:19.180 --> 11:21.110
and seriously injured Xie Lingqi.

11:22.020 --> 11:22.950
Immortal Luo Ge.

11:23.260 --> 11:23.940
Masters.

11:24.300 --> 11:25.730
The new King of the demon world and their masters

11:25.730 --> 11:27.990
are attacking us from the back mountain.

11:29.180 --> 11:29.930
It's Fu.

11:30.770 --> 11:32.140
Immortal Master is already there.

11:32.140 --> 11:33.270
He asked me to get you

11:33.290 --> 11:34.660
and two masters to help.

11:35.060 --> 11:35.740
Now?

11:36.260 --> 11:36.740
Yes.

11:37.540 --> 11:38.300
You guys

11:38.380 --> 11:39.780
go help Immortal Master.

11:39.900 --> 11:40.830
I will try my best

11:41.220 --> 11:42.820
to hold up Four Seasons Monument.

11:42.820 --> 11:44.700
Fu's cultivation is not top-notch.

11:44.700 --> 11:45.860
We'll deal with the Demons.

11:45.860 --> 11:47.220
Just concentrate on restoring Four Seasons Monument.

11:47.220 --> 11:47.660
Okay.

12:28.700 --> 12:29.460
I knew

12:30.220 --> 12:32.020
it was you behind all this again.

12:32.020 --> 12:33.300
Then guess

12:34.650 --> 12:35.460
who will win

12:36.220 --> 12:37.780
this time.

12:49.220 --> 12:50.300
How dare you

12:50.300 --> 12:52.030
try to invade Immortal Palace?

13:00.780 --> 13:01.260
He Na!

13:17.300 --> 13:18.100
It's useless.

13:18.420 --> 13:20.750
You are unable to open the boundary alone.

13:20.780 --> 13:21.580
Ridiculous.

13:21.580 --> 13:22.640
You better give up.

13:22.860 --> 13:23.500
Bai Feng?

13:23.860 --> 13:24.790
Why are you here?

13:25.740 --> 13:26.770
What are you planning again?

13:26.770 --> 13:28.900
I'm not here to deal with you this time.

13:28.980 --> 13:29.780
Fu

13:29.940 --> 13:31.180
has been planning on something evil.

13:31.180 --> 13:33.110
He's even trying to hurt Luo Ge now.

13:35.340 --> 13:36.670
He's no match for Luo Ge.

13:37.140 --> 13:38.600
You'll have to listen to me

13:38.860 --> 13:40.790
if you want to break this boundary.

13:41.780 --> 13:43.420
Fu conspired against Demon King

13:43.420 --> 13:44.980
and took away his water energy.

13:44.980 --> 13:45.910
He is invincible

13:46.260 --> 13:47.860
in the Three Realms now.

13:48.660 --> 13:50.700
I am now going to break this boundary as well.

13:50.700 --> 13:51.500
I'm going to

13:51.860 --> 13:52.900
let go of the people

13:52.900 --> 13:53.940
Fu wants to trap.

13:54.780 --> 13:56.860
The reason why he forbade me to go to Immortal Palace

13:56.860 --> 13:58.990
must be because he tried to kill Luo Ge.

13:59.700 --> 14:00.940
As for our grudge,

14:02.060 --> 14:04.320
I will settle it with you sooner or later.

14:06.620 --> 14:07.700
I will also

14:08.500 --> 14:09.820
settle every evil deed

14:11.180 --> 14:12.940
you have done with you.

14:24.740 --> 14:25.420
He Na!

14:27.860 --> 14:28.300
He Na.

14:28.620 --> 14:29.500
Wake up, He Na!

14:30.650 --> 14:31.260
How is it?

14:38.020 --> 14:38.900
Fu

14:39.140 --> 14:40.740
even hurt his own brother.

14:41.340 --> 14:42.900
He's simply insane.

14:43.740 --> 14:45.020
He plotted against Demon King

14:45.020 --> 14:46.820
to take part of his water energy,

14:46.860 --> 14:49.540
and made a deal with the demon under the Four Seasons Monument

14:49.540 --> 14:51.870
to borrow part of the power of Supreme God.

14:54.180 --> 14:55.910
What exactly is he trying to do?

14:56.060 --> 14:57.820
Bewitched by that demon,

14:58.260 --> 14:59.820
he believed that Luo Ning's immortal energy

14:59.820 --> 15:01.900
had been exiled under Four Seasons Monument.

15:01.900 --> 15:02.500
So,

15:02.500 --> 15:03.700
now he wants to get the Moon Sword

15:03.700 --> 15:05.340
to break Four Seasons Monument

15:05.340 --> 15:07.400
and find Luo Ning's immortal energy.

15:08.540 --> 15:09.800
When I sneaked in here,

15:10.060 --> 15:12.020
I found that the guards here were very loose.

15:12.020 --> 15:13.550
There are no masters at all.

15:14.100 --> 15:15.540
He has already led these masters

15:15.540 --> 15:17.300
to attack Four Seasons Monument.

15:17.300 --> 15:18.180
I thought

15:18.180 --> 15:19.860
that he would not hurt Luo Ge

15:19.860 --> 15:20.990
for Luo Ning's sake.

15:21.980 --> 15:24.940
But I found that even Demon King in White was hurt by him,

15:24.940 --> 15:26.540
so I stopped counting on him.

15:30.530 --> 15:31.940
Fu is really insane.

15:35.300 --> 15:35.900
Luo Ge!

15:36.380 --> 15:37.640
Luo Ge, can you hear me?

15:48.860 --> 15:50.380
Luo Ge!

16:00.460 --> 16:01.060
Luo Ge!

16:02.340 --> 16:04.260
Answer me if you are safe.

16:04.820 --> 16:07.480
Could Luo Ge have already been plotted against?

16:07.980 --> 16:09.420
Immortal Palace has boundaries.

16:09.420 --> 16:10.420
Fu can't get in.

16:15.780 --> 16:16.330
He Na.

16:18.620 --> 16:19.180
Liu Shao.

16:19.740 --> 16:21.270
Hurry back and inform Luo Ge

16:21.900 --> 16:23.820
that the boundaries in Immortal Palace

16:23.820 --> 16:25.060
can no longer stop Fu.

16:25.780 --> 16:26.840
Using Melody Flute

16:27.180 --> 16:28.640
can help you suppress him.

16:29.140 --> 16:30.540
I'm going to inform Luo Ge right now.

16:30.540 --> 16:31.800
Take care of yourself.

16:32.060 --> 16:33.060
I'll go with you.

16:33.260 --> 16:34.340
I can help.

16:55.700 --> 16:56.580
Luo Ge.

16:57.300 --> 16:58.700
Now that you are injured,

16:59.820 --> 17:00.820
you can't beat me.

17:01.500 --> 17:03.940
As long as I hold out until the Demons are defeated,

17:03.940 --> 17:04.740
you lose.

17:07.140 --> 17:08.400
Do you really think so?

17:08.619 --> 17:10.380
As long as Fu gets Moon Sword,

17:11.060 --> 17:12.740
then you lose.

17:29.100 --> 17:29.630
Who is it?

17:36.100 --> 17:36.810
Luo Ge.

17:37.450 --> 17:39.250
I don't want to make Luo Ning sad,

17:39.340 --> 17:40.460
so I won't kill you.

17:41.420 --> 17:43.460
But you have already lost most of your spiritual power,

17:43.460 --> 17:44.860
and couldn't beat me now.

17:45.220 --> 17:46.100
Be smart,

17:46.940 --> 17:48.660
and hand over your Moon Sword.

17:50.780 --> 17:51.540
So,

17:52.500 --> 17:54.740
your so-called attacking Immortal Palace

17:54.740 --> 17:56.540
is just a lie.

17:57.460 --> 17:58.660
And your real purpose

17:59.860 --> 18:01.320
is Four Seasons Monument.

18:09.500 --> 18:10.100
Everyone,

18:12.770 --> 18:14.230
Demon King has succeeded.

18:14.300 --> 18:16.330
He asked us to go back to the demon world first.

18:16.330 --> 18:17.020
Bai Feng?

18:17.980 --> 18:20.330
Didn't Demon King forbid you to come to Immortal Palace?

18:20.330 --> 18:22.140
He made me stay in the demon world

18:22.420 --> 18:24.180
just to keep me on call.

18:24.780 --> 18:25.500
What?

18:25.860 --> 18:27.590
I've worked for him for so long.

18:27.620 --> 18:28.980
Don't you believe me?

18:33.620 --> 18:34.350
Come with me!

18:36.540 --> 18:37.070
Retreat!

18:47.650 --> 18:48.180
Senior.

18:48.490 --> 18:49.420
What's going on?

18:49.740 --> 18:50.470
I don't know.

18:50.820 --> 18:51.820
We can't let them go.

18:51.820 --> 18:52.220
Wait.

18:52.940 --> 18:54.470
Don't you think it's weird?

18:54.620 --> 18:55.500
Fu is not here.

18:56.140 --> 18:57.740
Should we go back to Lusitai first?

18:57.740 --> 18:59.340
But there must be something wrong

18:59.340 --> 19:01.400
about this sudden move of the Demons.

19:07.620 --> 19:08.480
Where's Luo Ge?

19:08.660 --> 19:10.940
Luo Ge is guarding the Four Seasons Monument at Lusitai.

19:10.940 --> 19:11.810
Just him?

19:12.540 --> 19:13.220
Besides him,

19:13.220 --> 19:14.660
there seems to be Immortal Master there.

19:14.660 --> 19:15.590
But Bai Feng said

19:15.810 --> 19:18.330
that Immortal Master Wanwu has been bewitched by that demon.

19:18.330 --> 19:19.140
What?

19:21.180 --> 19:22.310
We've been tricked.

19:29.740 --> 19:31.940
Four Seasons Monument is not the point.

19:32.540 --> 19:36.800
The point is that Luo Ning's immortal energy is under Four Seasons Monument.

19:38.660 --> 19:40.500
And the person under that monument

19:40.500 --> 19:42.160
can help me see Luo Ning again.

19:43.940 --> 19:45.270
Don't mention Luo Ning.

19:45.980 --> 19:46.820
A man like you

19:46.820 --> 19:48.500
who would even hurt his own brother

19:48.500 --> 19:49.960
is not worthy of my sister.

19:50.220 --> 19:53.140
What happened between me and my brother has nothing to do with you.

19:53.140 --> 19:55.340
I just borrowed his strength temporarily.

19:55.340 --> 19:57.500
I will use the Three Realms to pay him back.

19:57.500 --> 19:58.340
Temporarily?

19:59.980 --> 20:02.380
He Na was seriously injured because of you in the Great Wilderness,

20:02.380 --> 20:04.860
and he could only rely on the power of water energy to relieve his injuries.

20:04.860 --> 20:06.390
Taking his water energy now

20:07.020 --> 20:08.860
is no different from taking his life.

20:08.860 --> 20:10.120
Stop scaremongering.

20:11.290 --> 20:11.980
No one

20:13.140 --> 20:15.490
can prevent me from seeing Luo Ning again.

20:17.460 --> 20:18.010
Ge.

20:20.740 --> 20:21.800
I'll deal with him.

20:22.740 --> 20:23.740
Immortal Master,

20:24.220 --> 20:26.460
he now has 30% of the power of Supreme God.

20:26.460 --> 20:28.340
And he also combined it with He Na's water energy.

20:28.340 --> 20:29.670
You're no match for him.

20:33.100 --> 20:33.820
I'll do it.

20:38.940 --> 20:39.450
Luo Ge,

20:39.620 --> 20:41.820
be careful with Immortal Master Wanwu.

20:55.740 --> 20:56.600
It turns out...

20:57.500 --> 20:59.220
that you are no longer Immortal Master.

20:59.220 --> 21:00.860
It's too late.

21:03.900 --> 21:04.450
Luo Ge.

21:05.180 --> 21:06.580
Hand over the Moon Sword,

21:07.060 --> 21:08.540
and I will return it to you

21:09.220 --> 21:10.550
after I rescue Luo Ning.

21:20.260 --> 21:22.020
Let's see if you can get it.

21:22.780 --> 21:23.780
I'll fulfill you.

22:13.940 --> 22:14.900
I can do anything

22:15.220 --> 22:16.340
to save Luo Ning.

23:19.780 --> 23:22.510
You should be the one to bear this demonic poison.

23:23.620 --> 23:25.540
Do you now know how much pain

23:25.540 --> 23:27.140
Luo Ning has endured for you?

23:28.170 --> 23:30.420
Do you still want her to stay here alone?

23:31.330 --> 23:31.900
No.

23:33.820 --> 23:35.420
I will return it to you later.

24:51.060 --> 24:51.590
Luo Ning.

24:52.060 --> 24:52.820
Come out!

24:53.260 --> 24:54.220
Luo Ning's divine spirit

24:54.220 --> 24:56.580
is just below the God of the Moonlight's half heart.

24:56.580 --> 24:58.180
You have split the Four Seasons Monument.

24:58.180 --> 24:59.380
Let me help you

24:59.540 --> 25:00.740
release Supreme God.

25:14.980 --> 25:15.660
Luo Ning.

25:37.410 --> 25:38.220
Liu Shao?

25:43.730 --> 25:44.540
Liu Shao.

25:45.180 --> 25:46.910
Stop making useless attempts.

25:47.290 --> 25:49.020
Even Luo Ge couldn't stop me,

25:50.500 --> 25:51.460
let alone you.

26:03.740 --> 26:04.460
Luo Ge!

26:05.980 --> 26:06.980
Luo Ge, wake up!

26:07.460 --> 26:08.260
Luo Ge!

26:11.020 --> 26:12.140
Melody Flute?

26:13.820 --> 26:14.860
You're late.

26:15.220 --> 26:17.620
Supreme God has been released by me already.

26:17.620 --> 26:19.380
He will be out soon.

26:21.380 --> 26:22.170
My Luo Ning

26:22.900 --> 26:24.100
will also be revived.

26:33.500 --> 26:35.230
It has been ten thousand years.

26:35.980 --> 26:38.500
The day has finally arrived.

26:38.700 --> 26:39.140
Rong.

26:39.740 --> 26:41.180
Let's enable Xilun Formation

26:41.180 --> 26:42.310
before he comes out.

26:43.540 --> 26:44.220
No...

26:45.420 --> 26:46.770
Let's get rid of the evil spirit

26:46.770 --> 26:48.700
and return that half heart to Luo Ge

26:49.090 --> 26:50.350
to help him become God.

26:50.660 --> 26:52.450
Doing so can not only save Luo Ge,

26:52.450 --> 26:54.450
but also preserve the Three Realms.

26:54.460 --> 26:55.720
Go and help Luo Ge over.

26:56.780 --> 26:58.140
What are you waiting for?

26:58.140 --> 26:59.100
Luo Ge will become a demon

26:59.100 --> 27:00.460
if we wait any longer.

27:06.260 --> 27:06.860
But no one

27:06.860 --> 27:08.390
can be the eye of formation.

27:08.410 --> 27:08.980
I can.

27:10.700 --> 27:12.180
I can't let you take that risk.

27:12.180 --> 27:13.020
No.

27:13.180 --> 27:13.940
You should be decisive

27:13.940 --> 27:15.380
as a man.

27:16.020 --> 27:17.380
If we fail this time,

27:17.380 --> 27:20.580
you will be responsible for protecting Immortal Palace.

27:48.330 --> 27:49.140
Senior.

28:32.380 --> 28:33.900
Do you really think this simple Xilun Formation

28:33.900 --> 28:35.660
can stop me?

28:39.940 --> 28:42.380
I'm about to make it.

29:10.700 --> 29:12.420
Don't ruin my plan!

29:15.380 --> 29:16.420
Xilun Formation.

29:22.420 --> 29:22.860
No!

29:23.540 --> 29:24.170
No!

29:24.420 --> 29:25.260
No!

30:13.460 --> 30:13.990
Luo Ning.

30:15.860 --> 30:17.460
Luo Ning hasn't come out yet.

30:18.220 --> 30:18.980
Come on!

30:27.140 --> 30:27.700
Luo Ge!

30:27.940 --> 30:29.180
You suppressed the evil spirit

30:29.180 --> 30:30.510
and became Supreme God.

30:32.260 --> 30:35.390
But the evil spirit has not been completely eliminated.

30:38.740 --> 30:39.300
Rong.

30:40.020 --> 30:42.020
You've finally become an Immortal.

30:49.820 --> 30:50.460
Senior!

30:54.420 --> 30:55.420
Master Zhuo!

30:56.620 --> 30:57.300
Senior.

31:00.300 --> 31:00.760
Senior.

31:01.450 --> 31:02.380
You will be fine.

31:06.620 --> 31:07.620
Hang in there.

31:10.380 --> 31:10.980
Senior.

31:12.060 --> 31:13.020
I have become Immortal.

31:13.020 --> 31:13.980
Did you see this?

31:15.180 --> 31:15.860
Senior!

31:18.220 --> 31:19.680
You said you would marry me

31:19.740 --> 31:21.340
as soon as I became Immortal.

31:36.770 --> 31:37.230
Senior.

31:38.500 --> 31:39.180
Senior!

31:41.620 --> 31:42.460
Senior!

31:47.690 --> 31:48.260
Luo Ge.

31:48.540 --> 31:49.620
Please help me

31:49.940 --> 31:50.850
save her.

31:53.370 --> 31:54.300
I can't help you.

31:54.660 --> 31:55.990
You are now Supreme God.

31:56.140 --> 31:58.070
You must be able to save her, right?

31:58.140 --> 31:58.740
I'm sorry.

32:11.060 --> 32:12.620
You will come back, right?

32:14.660 --> 32:16.020
I'll wait for you

32:16.620 --> 32:18.020
to come back and marry me.

32:35.810 --> 32:40.210
These are the six talisman pearls I used to maintain the Four Seasons Monument.

32:48.260 --> 32:49.860
You will become an Immortal.

32:50.180 --> 32:51.820
Your talisman pearls were tempered

32:51.820 --> 32:53.180
during the suppression of Four Seasons Monument,

32:53.180 --> 32:55.180
which could greatly improve your cultivation.

32:55.180 --> 32:58.910
This can be regarded as your reward from the Four Seasons Monument.

33:01.780 --> 33:02.460
Why?

33:03.860 --> 33:05.460
Why didn't Luo Ning come out?

33:06.580 --> 33:07.380
Could it be...

33:10.220 --> 33:12.020
Could it be that you guys hid her?

33:13.660 --> 33:15.720
She must be in that half of your heart.

33:23.060 --> 33:25.380
Luo Ning is not under Four Seasons Monument.

33:25.380 --> 33:27.140
Outside Four Seasons Monument,

33:27.140 --> 33:29.870
there are countless wronged souls caused by you.

33:32.380 --> 33:35.110
It was you who caused my sister to die with regret.

33:39.340 --> 33:40.140
Is there...

33:41.980 --> 33:43.180
Is there really no way

33:44.220 --> 33:46.210
to bring Luo Ning back?

34:01.740 --> 34:04.270
My sister was protecting you before she died,

34:05.580 --> 34:07.180
so I tried to spare you.

34:07.620 --> 34:11.260
But you were so obsessed that you have caused chaos in the Three Realms

34:11.260 --> 34:12.860
and caused people to suffer.

34:13.699 --> 34:15.960
Today I will kill you, the chief culprit,

34:16.060 --> 34:17.860
for the sake of the Three Realms.

34:25.580 --> 34:26.460
Luo Ning.

34:27.610 --> 34:28.540
Luo Ning!

34:30.260 --> 34:32.260
This is Luo Ning's immortal energy.

34:32.449 --> 34:34.060
Moon Sword didn't hurt him

34:35.580 --> 34:39.440
because he was protected by Bone-corroding Harp's spiritual power.

34:42.020 --> 34:43.940
This saved Luo Ning's sense.

34:53.900 --> 35:00.630
♫In the sea of clouds, I looked at the reflection of the moon in the water♫

34:56.940 --> 34:57.650
Fu.

34:58.940 --> 35:00.540
You did something bad again.

35:02.580 --> 35:03.220
Luo Ning.

35:02.620 --> 35:06.790
♫I kept waiting and arched my palms into a circle♫

35:03.780 --> 35:05.060
I've been looking for you.

35:05.060 --> 35:06.490
And all this time you have always been in...

35:06.490 --> 35:07.940
the Wishful Bead.

35:08.370 --> 35:14.610
♫The reflection gradually reminded me of our first meeting♫

35:15.310 --> 35:20.500
♫I can no longer tell the difference between wind and rain♫

35:19.540 --> 35:20.460
Luo Ning.

35:21.710 --> 35:25.350
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

35:23.340 --> 35:25.870
We have been looking for Luo Ning's immortal energy.

35:25.870 --> 35:29.370
♫I can't forget you♫

35:26.260 --> 35:27.060
It turned out

35:29.370 --> 35:32.960
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

35:29.380 --> 35:31.040
she had been with Fu all along.

35:31.260 --> 35:33.220
She has been by Fu's side

35:33.210 --> 35:35.980
♫I have no other choice♫

35:33.500 --> 35:34.700
with the last bit of spiritual power of Bone-corroding Harp.

35:34.700 --> 35:35.740
Luo Ning!

35:35.980 --> 35:39.540
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

35:39.540 --> 35:42.370
♫For billions of years♫

35:42.930 --> 35:46.590
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

35:44.620 --> 35:45.500
In this war,

35:46.410 --> 35:47.540
Four Seasons Monument was destroyed,

35:46.590 --> 35:49.510
♫A few hasty nights♫

35:48.460 --> 35:51.420
Immortal Master was bewitched by the evil spirit and fell into a coma,

35:49.940 --> 35:53.710
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

35:52.740 --> 35:53.600
and Master Zhuo

35:53.710 --> 35:57.120
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

35:53.860 --> 35:55.940
was petrified by the Xilun Formation.

35:55.940 --> 35:57.180
We have lost so much

35:57.120 --> 36:05.180
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch, and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

35:58.340 --> 36:00.340
just to purify this half of my heart.

36:05.020 --> 36:06.420
It turns out that Luo Ning

36:07.060 --> 36:09.020
has been by Fu's side all along.

36:18.860 --> 36:26.030
♫The remaining flowers in the mirror reflect the moon in the water♫

36:27.300 --> 36:31.950
♫We can't live up to such a good time♫

36:28.980 --> 36:29.660
I heard

36:29.780 --> 36:31.910
that he not only killed Fairy Luo Ning,

36:31.940 --> 36:33.540
but also took his brother's water energy.

36:33.000 --> 36:39.480
♫Recalling the unforgettable glance at the beginning♫

36:33.820 --> 36:34.820
A villain like him

36:35.300 --> 36:36.980
will definitely be devoured by the evil spirit immediately

36:36.980 --> 36:38.740
after entering there.

36:39.180 --> 36:40.020
He deserves it.

36:40.020 --> 36:43.550
♫I realized that it was a thousand years ago♫

36:40.820 --> 36:41.260
Go.

36:41.380 --> 36:41.780
Go.

36:43.550 --> 36:46.610
♫Is this bad luck, or good luck?♫

36:46.610 --> 36:50.230
♫He said that responsibility and love are difficult to balance♫

36:50.230 --> 36:53.070
♫He had no choice but to leave me♫

36:53.750 --> 36:57.310
♫The past has passed, so do not linger♫

36:57.310 --> 37:00.020
♫My love for you is still so strong♫

37:00.650 --> 37:04.330
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

37:04.330 --> 37:07.890
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

37:07.890 --> 37:15.830
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch, and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

37:16.250 --> 37:19.700
♫Life is like a grain of sand♫

37:19.700 --> 37:23.140
♫It burns the fire in my heart♫

37:21.580 --> 37:22.110
Luo Ning.

37:23.330 --> 37:31.150
♫I want to burn myself to hear you say that you have never changed♫

37:24.420 --> 37:26.150
I've done so many wrong things.

37:27.890 --> 37:29.490
Are you still protecting me?

37:31.890 --> 37:32.860
Is it worth it?

37:40.260 --> 37:41.820
I will deal with you.

37:43.980 --> 37:45.310
Don't you hurt Luo Ning!

37:49.580 --> 37:50.220
Come on!

38:01.260 --> 38:01.940
I heard

38:02.060 --> 38:03.260
that General Fu

38:03.500 --> 38:05.560
was imprisoned in Bone Melting Pool.

38:10.700 --> 38:12.340
With the chaos he caused,

38:13.540 --> 38:15.020
it's reasonable for him

38:16.140 --> 38:18.140
to end his life in Bone Melting Pool.

38:19.980 --> 38:21.910
But he is my only brother after all.

38:23.810 --> 38:25.300
I was also responsible

38:27.100 --> 38:29.030
for the way things have turned out.

38:29.740 --> 38:30.500
After all,

38:31.620 --> 38:32.950
I pampered him too much,

38:33.940 --> 38:36.060
to make him such a villain.

38:39.700 --> 38:40.180
My Lord,

38:41.340 --> 38:44.900
you two brothers are the only ones left with the blood of Demon King.

38:44.900 --> 38:46.700
I don't know how long General Fu

38:46.700 --> 38:48.560
can survive in Bone Melting Pool.

38:49.100 --> 38:51.580
And your injury is so serious.

38:56.020 --> 38:57.650
Aren't you worried

38:58.740 --> 39:01.270
the Demons will lose their king in the future?

39:03.180 --> 39:05.210
But the things he did this time

39:05.780 --> 39:08.020
has brought disaster to the Three Realms.

39:08.020 --> 39:09.100
I can't help him.

39:12.130 --> 39:13.020
I just hope

39:14.380 --> 39:15.700
he can truly repent

39:17.260 --> 39:18.860
and stop doing wrong things.

39:25.460 --> 39:27.020
Although Master Zhuo was petrified,

39:27.020 --> 39:28.300
she may still survive.

39:28.980 --> 39:29.900
Why didn't Supreme God Luo Ge

39:29.900 --> 39:31.420
try to save her?

39:33.500 --> 39:33.980
Girl.

39:35.780 --> 39:36.780
What did you say?

39:37.940 --> 39:38.580
I mean,

39:38.820 --> 39:40.340
with Master Zhuo's situation,

39:40.340 --> 39:41.220
it is possible

39:41.460 --> 39:42.990
for Supreme God to save her.

39:44.660 --> 39:45.660
I'm just worried

39:46.340 --> 39:48.140
if it's because the evil spirit on that half of the heart

39:48.140 --> 39:49.340
hasn't been removed,

39:50.020 --> 39:51.740
so he couldn't use the power of Supreme God

39:51.740 --> 39:53.100
as he wants.

39:54.300 --> 39:54.980
If so,

39:55.260 --> 39:56.060
what if

39:56.740 --> 39:58.140
he accidentally loses his mind

39:58.140 --> 40:00.020
like God of the Moonlight?

40:42.620 --> 40:43.460
Luo Ge.

40:43.740 --> 40:45.380
You didn't expect

40:45.780 --> 40:47.980
that I would come out in the end, did you?

40:48.340 --> 40:48.980
And

40:50.060 --> 40:52.900
I came into this world through your body.

40:53.780 --> 40:54.580
Do you think

40:55.660 --> 40:56.900
you'll win?

40:57.140 --> 40:57.980
Get lost!

41:16.580 --> 41:18.580
What's the matter with the weather?

41:22.410 --> 41:25.260
Would Immortal Palace have rainstorms and thunderstorms like the human world?

41:25.260 --> 41:26.720
The lightning and thunder

41:26.740 --> 41:28.140
reminded me of the birth

41:28.380 --> 41:30.260
of that evil spirit ten thousand years ago.

41:30.260 --> 41:31.220
Ten thousand years ago?

41:31.220 --> 41:32.100
That's right.

41:32.340 --> 41:34.180
I had just transformed into a human being at that time.

41:34.180 --> 41:36.220
The weather was the same then as it is now.

41:36.220 --> 41:37.340
Later I found out

41:37.620 --> 41:39.300
that it was because that evil spirit came out.

41:39.300 --> 41:41.160
Could it be that Luo Ge has been...

41:41.900 --> 41:42.580
Luo Ge?

41:43.740 --> 41:44.540
Luo Ge!
